  "synopsis": "Ye Xi was an ordinary girl, nothing special. She wasn't the worst at anything, but she was never the best either. She was as invisible as air, utterly unremarkable. Until she met Li Zhao…\n\nLi Zhao had her own goals; she wanted to become a top fashion designer. From a young age, every step she took was a step closer to her dream.\n\nThis is the story of a group of girls who met through fashion and are pursuing their dreams, occasionally interspersed with some lighthearted and silly everyday moments!\n\n(Source: Bangumi, translated)",
